FILE: rules.rs
MOD: commands/rules
OWNS: fitness rule display — lists all rules or filters by module name
PROFILE: [io, pure-core]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: volatile

run: Option<&str> * bool → Result<(), String> [io, boundary]
  calls: ArchContext::load, run_filtered, run_all

run_filtered: &str * &[Rule] * bool → Result<(), String> [pure]
  note: matches no_dependency (from/to), boundary (modules/module), no_import_from (from), restrict_callers_to (module)

run_all: &[Rule] * bool → Result<(), String> [pure]
  note: formats all rule types; unknown types fall through to generic display

to_list: &Rule → Vec<String> [pure]
  note: handles both serde_yaml::Value::String and ::Sequence for Rule.to field

DEPENDS-ON: context, schema

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- run_filtered must be updated whenever a new rule type is added to schema — silently omitting a type causes the filtered view to return "No rules reference module" for modules covered only by that type

